  description: Current-scene BMW, assembled through the shared vehicle framework. Model scale and visual geometry preserved; wheel and caliper geometry bound to suspension. Existing handling, audio and catalogue IDs retained. Cockpit controls and wipers need an artist rig.
  provenance: Generated from the installed PC CARS directory and resolved pvehicle/engineaudio database references. PC database inheritance and ordered script fields; recovered AEMS sample selection, sustain loops and surface references. Unity adapts telemetry, volume, GIN blending and spatialization. Base sound upgrades. Original-game time-stretch/filter DSP, random sequence and sputter mixer callbacks are not reproduced.
